{
    "title": "Made-in-China B2B Trade Online",
    "description": "The Made-in-China.com App is a world leading wholesale mobile B2B marketplace for global trade. Buy products from quality Chinese suppliers all from your mobile device conveniently. \r\n\r\n<b>3 STEPS</b> to complete your transaction:\r\n<b>Search Products > Place Orders > Trade Safely</b>\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Shop What You Need</b>\r\nWe provide safe and reliable online trading services. All transaction processes can be completed in our app. You can place an order and track your order anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Easy Sourcing</b>\r\nSource millions of new and innovative products from Verified Suppliers. 40,000,000 products from 27 categories are all for your purchase requirements. Now you can easily select and compare products.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b>Get Multiple Quotations</b>\r\nPost customized sourcing requests, you will receive price quotes in 24 hours. \r\n6,000,000 suppliers gathered here are trade agents, wholesalers, retailers, manufacturers and SMEs, fulfilling the demands from sellers on Amazon, eBay, wish, etsy, mercari, lazada and so on.\r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Keep in Touch</b>\r\nSend inquiries to get latest factory discounts or sample requests. Chat directly with suppliers by TradeMessenger system. \r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Brand New Smart Expo</b>\r\nHold various online exhibitions that simultaneous with major trade fairs from all over the world. No matter where you are, you can efficiently browse the virtual booths and start face-to-face online meetings with exhibitors at once.\r\n \r\n\u2605 <b>Member Events</b>\r\nOrganize diverse forms of member events on a regular basis. Semi-monthly live video streaming, celebration activities during festivals, events that open to everyone...... All is waiting for you!\r\n\r\n\u2605 Languages & Currencies Supported\r\nThe Made-in-China.com supports 16 popular languages: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Russian, Italian, German, Dutch, Arabic, Korean, Japanese, Hindi, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Indonesian. And 18 local currencies are now available.\r\n\r\nMoreover\r\n\u2713 Get most relevant recommendations based on your sourcing preferences.\r\n\u2713 Share products and suppliers on Facebook, Twitter, Pinterest, etc.\r\n\u2713 \u201cFeatured\u201d channel helps you find trustworthy suppliers and high-quality products.\r\n\r\nThe Made-in-China.com App, a must-have app in global B2B trade!\r\n<h2>DOWNLOAD NOW AND GROW YOUR BUSINESS!</h2>",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Made-in-China.com App is a world leading wholesale mobile B2B marketplace for global trade. Buy products from quality Chinese suppliers all from your mobile device conveniently. <br><br><b>3 STEPS</b> to complete your transaction:<br><b>Search Products &gt; Place Orders &gt; Trade Safely</b><br> <br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Shop What You Need</b><br>We provide safe and reliable online trading services. All transaction processes can be completed in our app. You can place an order and track your order anytime, anywhere.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Easy Sourcing</b><br>Source millions of new and innovative products from Verified Suppliers. 40,000,000 products from 27 categories are all for your purchase requirements. Now you can easily select and compare products.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b>Get Multiple Quotations</b><br>Post customized sourcing requests, you will receive price quotes in 24 hours. <br>6,000,000 suppliers gathered here are trade agents, wholesalers, retailers, manufacturers and SMEs, fulfilling the demands from sellers on Amazon, eBay, wish, etsy, mercari, lazada and so on.<br><br>\u2605 <b>Keep in Touch</b><br>Send inquiries to get latest factory discounts or sample requests. Chat directly with suppliers by TradeMessenger system. <br><br>\u2605 <b>Brand New Smart Expo</b><br>Hold various online exhibitions that simultaneous with major trade fairs from all over the world. No matter where you are, you can efficiently browse the virtual booths and start face-to-face online meetings with exhibitors at once.<br> <br>\u2605 <b>Member Events</b><br>Organize diverse forms of member events on a regular basis. Semi-monthly live video streaming, celebration activities during festivals, events that open to everyone...... All is waiting for you!<br><br>\u2605 Languages &amp; Currencies Supported<br>The Made-in-China.com supports 16 popular languages: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Russian, Italian, German, Dutch, Arabic, Korean, Japanese, Hindi, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Indonesian. And 18 local currencies are now available.<br><br>Moreover<br>\u2713 Get most relevant recommendations based on your sourcing preferences.<br>\u2713 Share products and suppliers on Facebook, Twitter, Pinterest, etc.<br>\u2713 \u201cFeatured\u201d channel helps you find trustworthy suppliers and high-quality products.<br><br>The Made-in-China.com App, a must-have app in global B2B trade!<br><h2>DOWNLOAD NOW AND GROW YOUR BUSINESS!</h2>",
